Subject: [PATCH 11/21] Oi review 1/5 night sea: snap weights within 0.002 of
 0/1 and always write endpoint changes (day restores authored exactly after
 0.001->0); readback checks x,y,z,w; re-write if overwritten while weights
 unchanged; tests S7-S9

(cherry picked from commit e869b092445a1bb8eb24e11e1a5ac2dacc4fc8dc)
